    "body": "> Also, accessibility: a <radiogroup> element would enable you to label the entire radio group which is currently impossible. Consider a form field about gender:\r\n\r\nThis is how to provide an accessible group label accessibility wise:\r\n```\r\n<fieldset>\r\n<legend>Gender:</legend>\r\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\" value=\"female\" /> Female </label>\r\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\" value=\"male\" /> Male </label>\r\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\" value=\"other\" /> Other </label>\r\n</fieldset>\r\n```",
