    "body": "@stevefaulkner I’m aware, but that’s not always a desirable solution. E.g. you may want a fieldset with a broader grouping than just this one field. You can label a `<select>` menu for this exact same choice, so why not be able to label a radio group? Note that just switching to a `<select>` menu instead is inadvisable for usability reasons: `<select>` menus are a usability bad practice when their options are too few (or too many, but that's not relevant here).",
