    "body": "I'm going to add-in my proposal from w3c/html#1508 to this ticket: **Add parent element functionality for radio inputs**. I originally proposed creating a new element `<inputgroup>`, but this feature could be implemented on the existing `<fieldset>` element. Just like Lea's proposal, my intention was to make grouping easier, rather than relying on the `name` attribute.\r\n\r\nMy old w3c ticket got a good amount of 👍's. Hear the voice of the people!",
